--Thank you very much!

00:14:21.700 --> 00:14:24.620
<i>Horosho! Ochen horosho</i>, Hibiki!

00:14:24.620 --> 00:14:26.620
I expected no less from my rival!

00:14:26.620 --> 00:14:28.250
That was stunning!

00:14:28.250 --> 00:14:30.290
So that's your hidden talent!

00:14:30.290 --> 00:14:34.830
Well, I wasn't hiding it, I just
didn't have a chance to show it.

00:14:34.830 --> 00:14:37.700
The judges' votes are in!

00:14:38.750 --> 00:14:44.700
We have a tie for first place between
Akemi Soryuin and Hibiki Sakura!

00:14:44.700 --> 00:14:48.450
According to the competition's rules,
they will face off again in a final round!

00:14:48.450 --> 00:14:50.040
--What?!
--A final round?!

00:14:50.040 --> 00:14:52.580
--Nice job!
--That's so cool!

00:14:52.580 --> 00:14:56.700
Well, this is a problem.
I can't think of anything else to do...

00:14:56.700 --> 00:14:58.120
I know, right?

00:14:58.120 --> 00:15:00.080
I wish they'd just choose one of us.

00:15:00.080 --> 00:15:02.250
Oh! I know, Hibiki!

00:15:02.250 --> 00:15:03.540
Why don't we just do that?

00:15:03.540 --> 00:15:06.410
That? That what?

00:15:06.410 --> 00:15:08.080
We'll now begin the final round!

00:15:08.080 --> 00:15:13.000
As you requested,
you'll have a bench press battle!

00:15:13.000 --> 00:15:15.620
First, you'll do 1 set of 10 reps at 40 kg.

00:15:15.620 --> 00:15:20.660
Then we'll add 5 kg at a time until
one of you can no longer continue.

00:15:20.660 --> 00:15:22.290
You're both okay with this?

00:15:22.290 --> 00:15:23.370
Yes!

00:15:26.830 --> 00:15:32.830
The bench press. It was our first workout
together after we signed up, Hibiki.

00:15:32.830 --> 00:15:35.700
Yeah, how could I forget?

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:40.870
It's a clever way to
determine the winner, Akemi.

00:15:40.870 --> 00:15:44.450
Back when we'd just met,
I could barely lift 20 kg.

00:15:44.450 --> 00:15:51.410
I know. Now you can lift 40 kg,
just like I could at the time.

00:15:51.410 --> 00:15:56.250
I'll come at you with all
the strength I have now!

00:15:56.250 --> 00:15:58.250
You're a worthy opponent!

00:15:58.250 --> 00:16:00.000
Let's fight with all our might!

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:01.040
Hibiki!

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.370
Akemi!

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:04.950
Ready, set, go!

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:24.870
--One... Two... Three...

00:16:24.870 --> 00:16:28.040
--At last, the time has come, Hibiki!
--One... Two... Three...

00:16:28.040 --> 00:16:33.410
Looking back, we couldn't settle this
with the relay or arm wrestling.

00:16:33.410 --> 00:16:37.410
But now I can finally
compete against you one-on-one!

00:16:37.410 --> 00:16:38.910
Six...

00:16:38.910 --> 00:16:40.790
Seven...

00:16:40.790 --> 00:16:43.250
Eight...

00:16:43.250 --> 00:16:46.450
Nine...

00:16:46.450 --> 00:16:47.580
Ten!

00:16:53.830 --> 00:16:57.700
I'm too hungry for this.

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:01.040
Soryuin-<i>san</i>, ten! Sakura-<i>san</i>, zero!

00:17:01.040 --> 00:17:03.330
The winner is Soryuin-<i>san</i>!

00:17:09.410 --> 00:17:13.620
I'm starving...

00:17:13.620 --> 00:17:16.660
Whaaaaaat?!

00:17:20.290 --> 00:17:22.410
Meanwhile, elsewhere...

00:17:27.120 --> 00:17:30.830
Chanjay... I'm sorry, really.

00:17:32.580 --> 00:17:36.290
You have nothing to apologize for.

00:17:36.290 --> 00:17:41.910
Our plan to reach Nikunoshima first
and set up a candid camera show...

00:17:41.910 --> 00:17:46.330
It was all ruined when our boat
broke down and we were set adrift.

00:17:46.330 --> 00:17:48.700
I'm so sorry, Chanjay.

00:17:48.700 --> 00:17:52.500
And you'd just joined the project.

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:55.330
Sir Deire, I...

00:17:56.830 --> 00:17:58.660
...I had fun...

00:18:02.660 --> 00:18:03.950
Chanjay?

00:18:09.250 --> 00:18:10.830
Chanjay...?

00:18:14.700 --> 00:18:16.540
Thank you...

00:19:56.410 --> 00:19:58.290
What a shame.

00:19:58.290 --> 00:20:02.540
I thought I could finally
meet you in a fair fight...

00:20:02.540 --> 00:20:04.370
You're still going on about that?

00:20:04.370 --> 00:20:08.450
You won, so you should be happy about it!

00:20:08.450 --> 00:20:13.750
But if you hadn't been so hungry,
you might've won.

00:20:13.750 --> 00:20:15.290
Don't you regret that?

00:20:17.830 --> 00:20:20.620
Nope! I had fun, so it's okay!

00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:40.200
If you hadn't muscled me into
joining the gym last spring,

00:20:40.200 --> 00:20:46.500
I wouldn't have had this experience,
or known how much fun strength training is.

00:20:46.500 --> 00:20:51.120
When I consider that,
losing is honestly not that big of a deal.

00:20:52.580 --> 00:20:54.200
Hibiki...

00:20:54.200 --> 00:20:55.450
Or something like that!

00:20:55.450 --> 00:20:58.700
I didn't mean to sound so sappy.

00:20:58.700 --> 00:21:02.750
As for me, if you hadn't joined the gym,

00:21:02.750 --> 00:21:08.580
I doubt I would've become so
close with Ayaka and Gina.

00:21:08.580 --> 00:21:10.700
It's all thanks to you.

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.370
Stay my friend, okay, Hibiki?

00:21:16.370 --> 00:21:18.450
Yeah, right back at ya!

00:21:24.040 --> 00:21:25.830
--Huh?!
--Wh-What's that?!

00:21:31.040 --> 00:21:36.500
I said I'll be back, and here I am,
Japanese geisha girls.

00:21:36.500 --> 00:21:37.910
Barnie?!

00:21:37.910 --> 00:21:39.500
It's Deire-<i>san </i>and Jason!

00:21:39.500 --> 00:21:41.080
What happened to them?!

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:44.040
About a week ago I received an
SOS from Jason's smartphone,

00:21:44.040 --> 00:21:47.250
so I came to rescue him.

00:21:47.250 --> 00:21:50.040
You should call a medic.

00:21:50.040 --> 00:21:51.700
This muscle pressure!

00:21:51.700 --> 00:21:53.000
It had to be you, Sir!

00:21:53.000 --> 00:21:54.660
What, Barnie?!

00:21:54.660 --> 00:21:56.830
Sakura-<i>san</i>, what just happened?!

00:21:56.830 --> 00:21:58.580
Well, you see...

00:21:58.580 --> 00:22:01.000
First, they did this, and then he did that...

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:02.160
Whoa, they had an accident?!

00:22:02.160 --> 00:22:03.660
And he came to rescue them?!

00:22:03.660 --> 00:22:05.910
Uh, how did you pick up on that?

00:22:05.910 --> 00:22:09.870
If you keep doing strength training,
you'll understand.

00:22:09.870 --> 00:22:11.620
Look, Hibiki!

00:22:11.620 --> 00:22:13.450
It's the Pectoralis Major constellation!

00:22:13.450 --> 00:22:15.410
I didn't need to know that!

00:22:17.160 --> 00:22:19.410
Time for our final training session!

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:22.330
Today, we'll do the most basic
exercise in bodyweight training--

00:22:22.330 --> 00:22:24.290
"Push-up"
the push-up!

00:22:24.540 --> 00:22:28.870
Like we said earlier, choose the method
that best suits your goals!

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:31.950
To work out your arms,
keep your hands close.

00:22:31.950 --> 00:22:35.290
Go wide if you want
to work out your chest.

00:22:35.290 --> 00:22:37.040
We'll do them for 20 seconds.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:40.040
If it gets too difficult, feel free to
switch to your knees at any time.

00:22:40.040 --> 00:22:44.540
If you can, try increasing
the number of reps by speeding up.

00:22:44.540 --> 00:22:47.000
But don't go too fast!

00:22:47.000 --> 00:22:49.790
Maintain the basic posture
and keep good form!

00:22:49.790 --> 00:22:51.950
No man is an island!

00:22:51.950 --> 00:22:54.200
And no one can live without muscles!

00:22:54.200 --> 00:22:57.750
Work out while giving
thanks to your muscles!

00:22:57.750 --> 00:22:59.160
All set?

00:22:59.160 --> 00:23:01.660
Ready, go!

00:23:01.660 --> 00:23:03.830
Breathe in as you go down!

00:23:03.830 --> 00:23:06.540
Breathe out as you go up!

00:23:07.950 --> 00:23:11.620
Don't overdo it,
or you'll hurt your shoulders!

00:23:11.620 --> 00:23:13.580
Appreciate your chest muscles!

00:23:13.580 --> 00:23:15.750
Lower your head and body all the way down!

00:23:15.750 --> 00:23:18.000
If you're struggling, use your knees!

00:23:18.000 --> 00:23:19.870
Thank your muscles!

00:23:19.870 --> 00:23:22.580
<i>Spasibo</i>, everyone!

00:23:22.580 --> 00:23:23.660
"Complete"
All done!

00:23:23.660 --> 00:23:25.950
Nice job!

00:23:25.950 --> 00:23:30.450
Be grateful for your muscles
and live a healthy life!

00:23:30.450 --> 00:23:32.120
That's it, everyone!

00:23:32.120 --> 00:23:34.330
See you later!
